DTEND:20151112T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261106T205806Z
UID:35gi82sll1cufac0cbibkqmtjg@google.com
CREATED:20150922T131813Z
DESCRIPTION:This year\, ACES and the St. Louis International Film Festival 
 are sponsoring a screening at SLUH of the documentary Black Girl in Suburbi
 a. The film looks into the experiences of black girls growing up in predomi
 nantly white communities. The director\, Melissa Lowery\, will introduce th
 e film and answer questions afterward. \n\nThis event is open to all.\n\nHe
 re are more details:\n\nBlack Girl in Suburbia\nWednesday\, November 11\n6:
 00-7:30 PM\nSLUH Si Commons (eastern side)\n\n\nHere is a flyer for the eve
 nt: https://goo.gl/t4DRPL\n\nHere is the film's website\, which includes a 
 trailer: http://www.blackgirlinsuburbia.com\n\n\nYou might offer this event
  as an extra credit opportunity to your students. Please let me know if you
  have any questions.\n\nThank you.\n\nFrank\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20151029T140114Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ACES Film Screening
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
