BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20151111
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20151112
DTSTAMP:20261106T205806Z
UID:16nfa4htikoo6k220r5haevg10@google.com
CREATED:20151028T142718Z
DESCRIPTION:\nThe technology committee has been reviewing Learning Manageme
 nt Systems (LMS). An LMS is a software application or Web-based technology 
 used to plan\, implement\, and assess a specific learning process. It provi
 des an instructor with a way to create and deliver content\, monitor studen
 t participation\, and assess student performance. In short\, an LMS would a
 llow us to streamline all of the technology we use in our classrooms onto a
  single platform. \n\nWe’ve been impressed by the Canvas LMS and would like
  to share what we’ve learned with all of you. We’ve invited a Canvas repres
 entative to come to campus on November 11th to demonstrate the product and 
 answer any questions you may have. \n\nWe will be hosting five 40 minute pr
 esentations between 10:30 a.m. and 2:00 p.m. on Wednesday\, November 11th. 
 We know you are busy\, so we’ll provide pizza and drinks during the present
 ations. \n\n  \n\nPlease sign up here to join one of the presentations.  \n
 \nAvailable times are: 10:30\, 11:15\, 12:00\, 12:45\, 1:30\n\n \n\nThank y
 ou\,\n\nYour Technology Committee\nTim Curdt\, Megan Menne\, Yude Huang\, D
 an See\, Anne Marie Lodholz\, Jonathan Ott\, Julie Moeser\, Lynne Casey & A
 ndrea Nunziante
LAST-MODIFIED:20151029T165534Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Canvas-LMS-Visit
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
