CREATED:20170110T173425Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>The following stude
 nts will be traveling to Washington D.C. for the March for Life and to atte
 nd the Cardinal O'Connor Conference on Life at Georgetown University.&nbsp\
 ; They will miss periods 5-7 on Thursday\, January 18th and all day on Frid
 ay\, January 19th.&nbsp\; While they will have designated times for study e
 ach day\, it may be difficult for them to turn in any major projects on Mon
 day\, 1/22\, especially those requiring extensive online access.&nbsp\; Tha
 nks for your patience and flexibility.&nbsp\; I've instructed all participa
 nts to meet with you by Thursday\, 1/11 and\, if possible\, to take any qui
 zzes or tests in advance.&nbsp\; Don't hesitate to reach out with any quest
 ions or concerns.&nbsp\; <br><br><br>Other students not on the list below m
 ay be missing to attend the March for Life with their parish.&nbsp\; <br><b
 r><br>Chaperones: Mr. Jonathan Ott\, Mr. Tom Kickham\, Mr. Dominic Lamantia
 \, Dr. David Callon\, Mrs. Laurie Milnor<br><br><br>Conrad Denault (18)<br>
 Allen Shorey (18)<br>Paul Gillam (18)<br>Max Kriegshauser (18)<br>Andrew Le
 ingang (18)<br>Dominic Pancella (18)<br><br>Patrick Hetlage (19)<br>Dean St
 arrs (19)<br><br>Charlie Perry (19)<br>Ethan Joly (19)<br><br>Michael Drabe
 lle (19)<br><br>Cole Banker (19)<br>Ben Blittschau (19)<br>Peter Campbell (
 19)<br>Christopher Ceriotti (19)<br>Bradley Kandlbinder (19)<br>Joe Manion 
 (19)<br>Max Mantych (19)<br><br>Michael Nolan (19)<br>Gavin Obert (19)<br>J
 ack Ruyle (19)<br>Chris Staley (19)<br><br>Tay Wiley (19)<br>Matthew Thibod
 eau (19)<br><br><br>Connor Steinlage (20)<br><br>Jacob Renfer (20)<br><br>T
 homas Reilly (20)<br><br>David Reddy (20)<br><br>Ben Garcia (20)<br>Nick Mc
 Laughlin (20)<br><br>Will McCann (20)<br>Reed Milnor (20)<br>Emmanuel Akpan
  (20)<br><br>Sutherland Litke (20)<br>Ray Bulte (20)<br>Mitchell Booher (20
 )<br>Dominic Nguyen (20)<br>Micah See (20)<br>Matt Uhlenbrock (20)<br><br><
 br>Matthew Wilmes (21)<br><br>Leo Lombard (21)<br>Sam Ruyle (21)<br><br>Ted
 dy Nolan (21)<br><br>Michael Buescher (21)<br>Henry Bourneuf (21)<br>Nichol
 as Campbell (21)<br>Blake Collins (21)<br><br><br>Peace\,<br>David Callon<b
 r><br><br><br>On Thu\, Jan 4\, 2018 at 9:54 AM\, Brock Kesterson <span dir=
 "ltr">&lt\;<a href="mailto:bkesterson@sluh.org" target="_blank">bkesterson@
 sluh.org</a>&gt\;</span> wrote:<br><span><br>Perfect.&nbsp\; Thanks.&nbsp\;
  I'll send it out to the faculty when I get it.<br><br><br><br><br><br>On T
 hu\, Jan 4\, 2018 at 9:37 AM\, David Callon <span dir="ltr">&lt\;<a href="m
 ailto:dcallon@sluh.org" target="_blank">dcallon@sluh.org</a>&gt\;</span> wr
 ote:<br><span><br>By the way\, I'm sending out the emergency contact form t
 oday and will also have the full roster in your office in a bit as well.&nb
 sp\; <br><br><br><br>On Thu\, Jan 4\, 2018 at 9:33 AM\, Brock Kesterson <sp
 an dir="ltr">&lt\;<a href="mailto:bkesterson@sluh.org" target="_blank">bkes
 terson@sluh.org</a>&gt\;</span> wrote:<br><span><br>Got it.<br><br><span><b
 r><br>On Thu\, Jan 4\, 2018 at 9:27 AM\, David Callon <span dir="ltr">&lt\;
 <a href="mailto:dcallon@sluh.org" target="_blank">dcallon@sluh.org</a>&gt\;
 </span> wrote:<br><span><br>The 2018 SLUH March for Life Pilgrimage is look
 ing for one more participant.&nbsp\; We fly out on Thursday\, 1/18 after 4t
 h period and return Sunday evening\, 1/21.&nbsp\; Cost is $300.&nbsp\; Fina
 ncial assistance is available.&nbsp\; In addition to the March for Life\, w
 e'll be attending a conference at Georgetown University\, touring the monum
 ents\, and visiting the Smithsonian museums for a day.&nbsp\; If interested
 \, contact Dr. Callon ASAP.&nbsp\; <a href="mailto:dcallon@sluh.org" target
 ="_blank">dcallon@sluh.org</a><br></span><br><br clear="all"><span><span co
 lor="#888888"><span><span color="#888888"><br></span></span></span></span><
 /span><span><span color="#888888"><span><span color="#888888"><span><span c
