UID:0kfldurtcnodnm30cc383h7ruj@google.com
CREATED:20200827T143751Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>Yearbook pictures for all&nbsp\;<b>Freshmen\, Sophomores\, 
 Juniors\, Faculty and Staff</b>&nbsp\;<i>(Seniors\, you can disregard this 
 email)</i> <b>will take place on</b>&nbsp\;<b>Monday\, Sept. 14 and Tuesday
 \, Sept 15</b><b>&nbsp\;in the back of the Field House on the auxiliary&nbs
 p\;court\, under the banners.&nbsp\;</b><br><br><b>FORMAL ATTIRE</b>&nbsp\;
 is required for the pictures. (Suit\, sport coat/blazer\, sweater\, sweater
  vest\, tie\, button down dress shirt\, belt\, socks\, dress shoes. NO athl
 etic tops.)<br><br>Below is the schedule of when students will be getting&n
 bsp\;their picture taken:<br><ul><li><b><font>Monday\, September 14 (A-L)</
 font></b><ul><li><b><font><span>Freshmen</span>&nbsp\;= 5th&nbsp\;period</f
 ont></b></li><li><b><font><span>Sophomores</span>&nbsp\;= 6th period</font>
 </b></li><li><b><font><span>Juniors</span>&nbsp\;= 7th period</font></b></l
 i></ul></li></ul><ul><li><b><font>Tuesday\, September 15 (M-Z)</font></b><u
 l><li><b><font><span>Sophomores</span>&nbsp\;= 5th&nbsp\;period<br></font><
 /b></li><li><b><font><span>Juniors</span>&nbsp\;= 6th period<br></font></b>
 </li><li><b><font><span>Freshmen</span>&nbsp\;= 7th period&nbsp\;</font></b
 ></li></ul></li></ul><b><font><span>*IMPORTANT:</span></font></b><br><ul><l
 i>If you are in class during an assigned&nbsp\;time&nbsp\;for your grade le
 vel to get their pictures taken\, <b><u><font>your teacher&nbsp\;has a sche
 dule of when during that period you will go to the Field House together</fo
 nt></u> </b>and get your pictures taken as a class. In short\, <b>report to
  class FIRST!</b></li><li>If you are<b>&nbsp\;<u><font>unscheduled</font></
 u></b>&nbsp\;during the time when your grade level is getting their picture
  taken\, please go to the back of the Field House&nbsp\;on the aux. court a
 t some point during that period to get your picture taken.&nbsp\;</li><li>I
 f you are in a<b>&nbsp\;<u><font>different grade level course section</font
 ></u></b>&nbsp\;(for example\, a freshman in a sophomore level course) eith
 er go with the class section you're in during the period if they are schedu
 led to get their pictures taken or make sure you get your picture taken at 
 some other point throughout the day. You can go if/when you're unscheduled 
 at some point during the day OR during 8th period before you leave.&nbsp\;<
 /li><li><b><u><font>8th period</font></u></b><b><u><font> is the fallback o
 ption</font></u> for any students and staff to get their picture taken if o
 ther times throughout the day don't work.</b>&nbsp\;</li></ul><br><br><font
 ><b><u>EVERY</u>&nbsp\;STUDENT &amp\; STAFF MEMBER IS EXPECTED TO HAVE THEI
 R PICTURE TAKEN DURING THESE DAYS BEFORE HE/SHE LEAVES SCHOOL.&nbsp\;</b></
 font><br><br>For anyone wanting to&nbsp\;<b>Order Prints</b>&nbsp\;of their
  school photo\, please go to&nbsp\;<a href="http://shop.hrimaging.com/">sho
 p.hrimaging.com</a>&nbsp\;and type in "St Louis Univ High School" to find y
 our picture.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200901T184939Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yearbook Pictures (Formal Attire)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
