DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20111009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20111010
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;UNTIL=20111010T070000Z;INTERVAL=1
DTSTAMP:20261106T205806Z
UID:88617050-4382-4378-ac15-f6bb9821bc3f
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20111005T155643Z
DESCRIPTION:The following students will be attending the Service Learning R
 etreat on Sunday Oct. 9 and Monday Oct. 10 . They should be speaking with t
 heir teachers about missing class on Monday . \n\nSeniors \n1. Stephen Nels
 on \n2. Matt Schoelch \n3. John Bromell \n4. Danny Hogan \n5. Joe Klein \n6
 . Greg Fister \n7. Elliot Glass \n8. Amir Paschal \n9. Jerry Rodgers \n10. 
 Luke Hagerty \n\nJuniors \n1. Alex Tarter \n2. August John \n\n\nThe theme 
 of the retreat is Homelessness. We will explore what it is like to be homel
 ess in St. Louis. We will look at poverty from several angles in conjunctio
 n with Catholic Social Teaching in an attempt to gain clarity about how our
  faith leads to action in regards to these issues. Please keep these studen
 ts in your prayers this weekend. \n\n\nNick \n\n\n\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230302T170703Z
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Service Learning Retreat
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
