DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20131021
DTSTAMP:20261106T205806Z
UID:876cad4f-3521-4a8a-8f62-459a11485e6d
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20130116T152311Z
DESCRIPTION:\n\nThe following students will be attending the Service Learni
 ng Retreat on Sunday Oct. 20 and Monday Oct. 21.  They should be speaking w
 ith their teachers about missing class on Monday.\n\nSeniors\n1. Sam Greave
 s\n2. Patrick Mooney\n3. Andrew Ney\n4. Peter Rackers\n5. Ross Roth-Johnson
 \n6. Christian Siegfried\n7. Danny Sullivan\n\nJuniors\n8. Garret Fox\n9. T
 om Gravlin\n10. Tom Lally\n11. Isaac Martel\n\nFaculty\nFrank Corley\nDan F
 inucane\n\n\nThe theme of the retreat is Homelessness. We will explore what
  it is like to be homeless in St. Louis. We will look at poverty from sever
 al angles in conjunction with Catholic Social Teaching in an attempt to gai
 n clarity about how our faith leads to action in regards to these issues. P
 lease keep these students in your prayers this weekend.\n\n\nNick
LAST-MODIFIED:20230302T171434Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Service Learning Retreat
TRANSP:OPAQUE
