BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20121007
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20121008
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;UNTIL=20121008T070000Z;INTERVAL=1
DTSTAMP:20261106T205806Z
UID:7c0fd8ce-b970-4330-96ac-57921c52afe8
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20121001T131830Z
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nThe following students will be attending the Service Lear
 ning Retreat on Sunday Oct. 7 and Monday Oct. 8. They should be speaking wi
 th their teachers about missing class on Monday. \n\nSeniors \n1. Kieran Co
 nnolly \n2. Andy Hitch \n3. Nicholas Hunsaker \n4. Lane Koch-Etzel \n5. Nat
 han Mackey \n6. Luke Mammen \n7. Robby Martineau \n8. Justin McManemin \n9.
  Joel Ocampo \n10. Matt Raeber \n11. Justin Seaton \n\n\nThe theme of the r
 etreat is Homelessness. We will explore what it is like to be homeless in S
 t. Louis. We will look at poverty from several angles in conjunction with C
 atholic Social Teaching in an attempt to gain clarity about how our faith l
 eads to action in regards to these issues. Please keep these students in yo
 ur prayers this weekend. \n\n\nNick \n\n\n\n\n\n-- \n\nBrock Kesterson \nAs
 sistant Principal for Student Life \nSt. Louis University High School \n314
 -531-0330 ext. 2135 \n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230302T171746Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Service Learning Retreat
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
