RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Chicago:20131021T150000
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20130116T152311Z
DESCRIPTION:\nThe following students will be attending the Service Learning
  Retreat on Sunday Oct. 20 and Monday Oct. 21.  They should be speaking wit
 h their teachers about missing class on Monday.\n\nSeniors\n1. Sam Greaves\
 n2. Patrick Mooney\n3. Andrew Ney\n4. Peter Rackers\n5. Ross Roth-Johnson\n
 6. Christian Siegfried\n7. Danny Sullivan\n\nJuniors\n8. Garret Fox\n9. Tom
  Gravlin\n10. Tom Lally\n11. Isaac Martel\n\nFaculty\nFrank Corley\nDan Fin
 ucane\n\n\nThe theme of the retreat is Homelessness. We will explore what i
 t is like to be homeless in St. Louis. We will look at poverty from several
  angles in conjunction with Catholic Social Teaching in an attempt to gain 
 clarity about how our faith leads to action in regards to these issues. Ple
 ase keep these students in your prayers this weekend.\n\n\nNick
